For example, use of the Software to internally build, test, monitor, secure, administer, or maintain an unrelated commercial product does not by itself constitute Commercial Exploitation of the Software.

This exception does not permit the organization to commercially provide the Software itself, a Modified Version, or functionality substantially supplied by the Software to external customers.

