## 28. No Mandatory Relicensing

You are not required to license Independent Components under this license.

You are not required to assign copyright in any contribution or modification to the Licensor.

You are not required to license an entire Modified Version, repository, application, executable, or Larger Work under these terms.

Covered Modifications may also be offered under additional licenses, provided that every recipient entitled to receive the Covered Modification under this license continues to receive at least the rights granted by this license.

Additional terms may not be used to make Licensed Components or Covered Modifications effectively closed source.

